{"data":{"body":"[P2] Restrict comments to runs that test the PR. `Build` also runs on `pull_request_target` label/unlabel events, and same-repository PRs pass its integration-job condition. Those runs check out the base revision but still populate this PR number. After this change merges, adding a label can therefore replace a PR slowdown warning with base-branch results, potentially clearing it without testing the PR again. Populate `PR_NUMBER` only for `pull_request` events.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPenXVs8AAAABDg5eXQ","finding_digest":"515ba5e4ae1bb7f09fba81b20b8a4207b354717fffe57137c275ceb304cf83d8","finding_id":"arf_v1_kfn2lzfodo37bh52qgzaxcsca6","finding_key":"github/workflows/integration-tests.yml::report-test-timings::pr-revision-only-comments","identity_key":"github/workflows/integration-tests.yml::report-test-timings::pr-revision-only-comments","line":93,"observation_digest":"f077c9feda8a6b6bf55d8c5413063c31f5706a7223f2d3d46c19c89f9b577d5a","observation_id":"aro_v1_6b34t7w2rjvwx5k5rrkbgbr4gh","path":".github/workflows/integration-tests.yml","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_kfn2lzfodo37bh52qgzaxcsca6","published_at":"2026-11-10T21:31:53Z","review_id":"arr_v1_6nj4jwkku2by65hz4bg7jbwqqy","reviewed_base_sha":"1ee22dc943ea875864e479327193e51af7d24c34","reviewed_head_sha":"ab4e47c7bd7f4e1b08320e761e0deb9e236dc479","reviewer":"codex","start_line":93,"suggestion_id":"arsg_v1_z7o2rk5fwgln3s2s3wx2exhdyl"},"pull_request":{"number":1214},"record_id":"art_v1_k2hrvv5f26nksw25w5jv7qmlza","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-11-10T21:31:53Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js","id":1038735190},"schema_version":1}
